This directory is loaded only after the user chooses a photo.

Included components, all under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE.md):

- Tesseract.js 6.0.1: tesseract.min.js, worker.min.js
- tesseract.js-core 6.0.0, LSTM only: tesseract-core-lstm.wasm.js, tesseract-core-simd-lstm.wasm.js
- English traineddata 4.0.0_best_int: eng.traineddata.gz

The app passes workerPath, corePath, and langPath to these local files.
Photos are not uploaded. The default CDN address inside the library is not used.
